OL,3,GNEWSAPiccadilly line services halted
OL,4,Afor 24-hour strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Piccadilly line is set to close
OL,7,Fover two days as Tube staff stage
OL,8,Fstrike action.
OL,10,FMembers of the Transport Salaried
OL,11,FStaffs' Association (TSSA) working in
OL,12,Fservice control are due to walk out for
OL,13,F24 hours at midday on Friday in a
OL,14,Fdispute over the sacking of one of
OL,15,Ftheir colleagues.
OL,17,FTransport for London (TfL) has warned
OL,18,Fof severe disruption to the line, with
OL,19,Fsome District line services also
OL,20,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
