OL,3,GNEWSAPiccadilly line services halted
OL,4,Afor 24-hour strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis strike is separate from planned
OL,7,FRMT industrial action over TfL's
OL,8,Fproposed four-day working week for Tube
OL,9,Fdrivers, which is due to affect the
OL,10,Fentire Underground network across eight
OL,11,Fdays from 26 November into the new
OL,12,Fyear.
